'''''Ceratodon''''' is a genus of [[mosses]] belonging to the family [[Ditrichaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Ceratodon Brid. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2673445 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=19 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref> The genus was first described by [[Samuel Elisée Bridel-Brideri]] and has a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF" />

==Species==
The following species are recognised in the genus ''Ceratodon'':
{{div col|colwidth=22em}} 
*''[[Ceratodon amazonum]]'' {{small|Nieto-Lugilde, O.Werner, S.F.McDaniel & Ros}}
*''[[Ceratodon bryophilus]]'' {{small|Besch.}}
*''[[Ceratodon conicus]]'' {{small|(Hampe ex Müll.Hal.) Lindb.}}
*''[[Ceratodon graefii]]'' {{small|Schlieph.}}
*''[[Ceratodon heterophyllus]]'' {{small|Kindb.}}
*''[[Ceratodon purpureus]]'' {{small|(Hedw.) Brid.}}
{{div col end}}

